<p style="font-size:14px;">
  <%= @inviter.name.presence || @inviter.email %> invited you to join
  <strong><%= @invitation.organization.name %></strong> on Pharma Transport as a
  <strong><%= @invitation.role %></strong>.
</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;">
  Pharma Transport records chain of custody and temperature for the shipments your team handles.
  Set your name and password to get started:
</p>
<p style="font-size:14px;"><%= link_to "Accept the invitation", @url %></p>
<p style="font-size:12px;color:#5b6b7c;">
  This link works once and expires <%= @invitation.expires_at.to_date.strftime("%B %-d, %Y") %>.
  If you weren't expecting it, ignore this email and nothing happens.
</p>
